WEBVTT

00:05:30.875 --> 00:05:33.334
And it was something special.

00:05:33.358 --> 00:05:36.747
I realized there was something
just extraordinary about Feynman,

00:05:36.771 --> 00:05:40.585
even when he did what he did.

00:05:43.414 --> 00:05:46.088
Dick -- he was my friend;
I did call him Dick --

00:05:46.112 --> 00:05:48.798
Dick and I had a little bit of a rapport.

00:05:48.822 --> 00:05:51.696
I think it may have been a special
rapport that he and I had.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.343
We liked each other;
we liked the same kind of things.

00:05:54.367 --> 00:05:57.850
I also like the intellectual macho games.

00:05:58.278 --> 00:06:00.358
Sometimes I would win,
mostly he would win,